# Environment files. Real values never get committed -- only the .env.example
# template does. See Day17/.env.example for what belongs where, and note that
# the two actual secrets in this project deliberately do NOT live in a .env:
# the SWA deployment token lives in GitHub Actions secrets, and Jwt:Secret
# lives in dotnet user-secrets (see the README).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.template

# Azure Functions local config -- holds whatever you put in it, so it is
# ignored and only the .example is tracked.
local.settings.json
